WEBVTT

00:00:03.399 --> 00:00:13.542
Your trip is saved. Download the PDF itinerary, editable Excel and receipt. Each button provides a different file. The PDF and Excel will also be available later in “My Trips”.

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:19.697
Keep your documents. You can use the button to email all three files. Download them too so they are easy to access. The demonstration points out the controls; it does not send new emails.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:37.700
Your PDF itinerary. Zoom in to read activity times, duration and notes. Then focus on another activity and its notes. Pause the video to read. Confirm opening times and tickets before booking.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:55.700
Continue with day trips. The day trip includes transport, visits and timing. We also zoom in on a visit where tickets need checking. The notes distinguish planning estimates from details to confirm before traveling.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:01:02.847
Explore your completed trip. Open your trip to explore each destination and prepare the services you need. Start with the itinerary or with trip preparation.
